  "description": "MEGREX crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C54 H86 Mn2 N12 O22 Tb4,2(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Mn1 (Mn) has 4 O neighbors; Tb1 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Mn1A (Mn) has 4 O neighbors; Tb1A (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb2A (Tb) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 11 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.257-3.897 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 98.69-113.52°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C54H90Mn2N12O24Tb4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
